---
source: crates/sirene-core/tests/plantuml.rs
expression: "@startuml\ntitle Request handling\nclock \"Clock\" as C with period 50\nbinary \"Enable\" as EN\nrobust \"Web Browser\" as WB\nconcise \"Web User\" as WU\nanalog \"Load\" as L between 0 and 10\n\nWB has \"Busy loading\" as Processing, Waiting, Idle\n\n@0\nWU is Idle\nWB is Idle\nEN is low\nL is 1\n\n@100 as :request\nWU is Waiting : clicks\nWB is Processing\nEN is high\nL is 8\n\n@300\nWB is Waiting\nWU is {-}\nL is 4\n\n@WU\n500 is Idle #palegreen\n+100 is {hidden}\n\n@:request+50\nWU -> WB : URL\n\nWB@300 -> EN@400 : done\nWB@100 <-> @+200 : {200 ms}\n@500 <-> @600 : {idle}\nhighlight 300 to 400 #Gold : Waiting\nnote bottom of WU : response\n@enduml\n"
---
                                   Request handling

                                                     =Waiting==
Clock                     --+  +-+ +-+  +-+ +-+  +-+ +--+ +-+ +--+ +-+ +--+ +-+  +-+ +-
                            +--+ +-+ +--+ +-+ +--+ +-+  +-+ +-+  +-+ +-+  +-+ +--+ +-+

Enable                             +---------------------------------------------------
                          ---------+
                                                              ^ done
Web Browser Busy loading           +-----------------+
                 Waiting           |                 +---------------------------------
                    Idle  ---------+
                                   <---- 200 ms ----->
                                        : URL
                                   clicks
Web User                  +--------+-----------------+-----------------+---------+
                          |  Idle  |     Waiting     |/////////////////|  Idle   |
                          +--------+-----------------+-----------------+---------+
                          response

Load
                                   +-----------------+
                                   |                 +---------------------------------
                                   |
                          ---------+

